cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "physprior: what does a physics prior buy you?"
abstract: >-
  A controlled comparison of physics-informed machine learning (PINNs and
  symbolic regression) against a purely data-driven neural network, on real
  measured data from LIGO, COBE/FIRAS, NIST and JPL, and on simulations where
  the governing law is known exactly.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
license: MIT
